<title>GERMANY: West German Oct industrial orders up 3.4 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>West German Oct industrial orders up 3.4 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economics Ministry reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> W.GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS     Oct 96    Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +3.4	 -3.6	 -5.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+7.5	 -1.6	  n/a</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		 97.6	 94.4	 90.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted, provisional and expressed in volume terms. Year-on-year changes are calculated by Reuters from Bundesbank data.</p>
</text>
